  "question": {
    "text": "The eccentricity of the hyperbola whose length of its conjugate axis is equal to half of the distance between its foci, is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "snJCp",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "vjzUz",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "9vSrl",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LRRgp",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For any standard hyperbola we know that</p><p>eccentricity,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt></math>,&nbsp;conjugate axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;and distance between the foci&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></math>.</p><p>Given,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
